      "title": "HPQ Q3 Earnings Call Puts Focus on Margin Recovery & AI PCs",
      "summary": "HP Inc. raised its fiscal 2026 non-GAAP EPS guidance to $3.19-$3.29 and free cash flow to $3-$3.2B, driven by pricing discipline, premium PC mix, and strong AI PC adoption at 46% of Q3 shipments. The company expects Personal Systems margins to bottom in Q4'26 before improving in FY27 through mitigation actions including product redesign and supplier optimization. Print segment margins remained strong at 18.1% despite a 2% revenue decline.",
